The '''Sullust system''' was a [[star system]]<ref name="Nightsisters" /> located in the [[Sullust sector]]<ref name="Tarkin" /> of the [[Outer Rim Territories]]. The [[Volcano|volcanic]] [[planet]] [[Sullust]] was located in the Sullust system.<ref name="Leia 2" />

